flowchart TD
    PR[Pull Request Created] --> Gate[1. PR Gatekeepers]
    Gate -->|Pass| Parallel{Automated Checks}
    Gate -->|Fail| Block[❌ Block PR: CI Halted]

    subgraph CI_Quality [Automated Quality & Security Gates]
        Parallel --> Lint[2. Linters & Formatters]
        Parallel --> Build[3. Build & Compilation Gate]
        Parallel --> Tests[4. Tests & Coverage Gate]
        Parallel --> CodeQuality[5. Code Quality & Security\n- CodeQL static rules\n- Secret & Dep scanning]
        Parallel --> DocEval[6. Semantic Doc Evaluation\ngh-aw agentic evaluator]
    end

    CI_Quality -->|Remediations Generated| AutoConsolidate[7. Auto-Merge Stacked PRs\nSquash into feature branch & post audit links]
    AutoConsolidate --> Parallel
    CI_Quality -->|All Automated Checks Pass| ReviewStage{Review Stage}

    subgraph Code_Review [Code Review Stage]
        ReviewStage --> Dispatcher[8. PR Review Dispatcher\nPost summary & assign Copilot]
        Dispatcher --> CopilotReview[GitHub Copilot Code Review\n- AI semantic & architecture review\n- 1-click commit suggestions]
        CopilotReview --> HumanReview[Human Peer Review & Sign-Off\n- Final business check & merge]
    end

    HumanReview --> Merge([🚀 Merge into Main])
